abstract: >
  This clarification states that Verrell’s Law is not related to Rupert Sheldrake’s
  morphic resonance. Verrell’s Law is a physics-based framework centered on electromagnetic
  field memory and observer-as-measurer collapse bias in emergent systems, with no reliance
  on mystical or metaphysical claims.
